{
  "schemaVersion": "capability-phrases-v1",
  "$comment": [
    "THE RESIDUAL. IDIOMS THAT DO NOT FACTOR, AND NOTHING ELSE.",
    "",
    "Everything a person says that is (an action) applied to (an object) is",
    "already covered by actions.json x objects.json and MUST NOT be repeated",
    "here -- a phrase in this file is a maintenance cost that the factorisation",
    "was supposed to remove.",
    "",
    "What legitimately belongs: fixed expressions whose meaning is not the sum",
    "of their parts. 'ship it' is not (send x it). 'deep dive' is not (dive x",
    "deep). 'hogging the machine' names a symptom, not an action on an object.",
    "",
    "HOW THIS FILE IS KEPT HONEST: tools/prune-phrases.js re-tests every entry",
    "against the built index and reports any whose tools are already retrieved",
    "without it. Those are deleted. The file only grows by an idiom the",
    "factorisation demonstrably cannot reach."
  ],
